      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add link__TRILIUM_PH_1__ dialog has a page for each kind of link, selected at its top: __TRILIUM_PH_2__Web page__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Note__TRILIUM_PH_5__ and, in a text note, __TRILIUM_PH_6__Heading / anchor__TRILIUM_PH_7__. Each page keeps what you entered on it while you look at another one. __TRILIUM_PH_8__Insert link__TRILIUM_PH_9__ (__TRILIUM_PH_10__Save link__TRILIUM_PH_11__ when changing a link) creates only the link of the page shown.",
